00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:40.026
they make a 32 yard field goal,

00:00:40.026 --> 00:00:41.712
and ya look hot.

00:00:41.712 --> 00:00:45.570
- I know, I was like, and
she was homecoming queen!

00:00:45.570 --> 00:00:46.700
- That's awesome.

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:49.240
- But anyway, how did you
become interested in sports?

00:00:49.240 --> 00:00:50.630
I always ask my friends that.

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:53.450
- Yeah, cause of my dad, my
dad's a great storyteller,

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:55.340
he's on television, and he would tell me

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:58.460
