what players liked each other,

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:00.000
and what players didn't like each other,

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:01.670
and what coaches had been with what teams,

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:03.630
and he was just a good, good storyteller.

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:05.210
So I became a fan that way.
- A teacher, really.

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:08.790
- Yeah, and so, I decided at an early age

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:10.180
I was gonna do it for a living.

00:01:10.180 --> 00:01:12.070
- That's a really cool thing.

00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:14.450
I just thought it's
something outta the ordinary.

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:16.120
- His favorite story is though,

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:18.100
not so much when I was like dad,

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:20.980
hey Larry Bird and Magic
Johnson and Kevin McHale,

00:01:20.980 --> 00:01:22.670
