let's have mom tell you

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:29.410
when we get home.

00:01:29.410 --> 00:01:31.523
- You know what, I'm gonna
cover sports, she's got that.

00:01:31.523 --> 00:01:32.650
(laughs)

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:35.140
So what advice do you have
for girls tryin' to, you know,

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:37.410
break into a male dominated field?

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:38.996
- Yeah, I mean, I think no matter

00:01:38.996 --> 00:01:41.440
if you're tryin' to be
a sports broadcaster

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:42.830
or you're tryin' to do anything else,

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:46.340
which really seems all male
dominated at this point,

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:47.750
I just say work really hard.

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:49.050
And another one, which I mean

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:50.480
I know you and I can relate to,

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:51.710
is have thick skin.

00:01:51.710 --> 00:01:53.680
Which, I'm still tryin' to work on,

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:55.760
but the unfortunate part,
and Kelly knows this

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:57.030
about being in the public eye,

00:01:57.030 --> 00:01:59.820
is everybody has an opinion,
and they can say it,

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:01.520
and they can post it on your Instagram,

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:04.140
and they can be livin' with
their mom at 50 years old

00:02:04.140 --> 00:02:07.015
in their mom's basement and
still have a fun opinion.

00:02:07.015 --> 00:02:10.460
It's taken me a long time
to try to have thick skin,

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:13.090
I think I'm really doing
a lot better about it

00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:13.923
than I used to.

00:02:13.923 --> 00:02:15.670
I feel like when you're in
your 20's and your 30's,

00:02:15.670 --> 00:02:17.775
you're like okay, stop, you're
really hurting my feelings.

00:02:17.775 --> 00:02:20.260
I'm in my 40's now, and
I'm like you know what,

00:02:20.260 --> 00:02:22.040
like I'm not doing it for you anyways.

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:23.404
So, still workin' on it.

00:02:23.404 --> 00:02:25.810
- That's the thing, yeah,
you should do it for you.

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:27.215
Tell us about your new project,

00:02:27.215 --> 00:02:28.048
I wanna hear about your new project.

00:02:28.048 --> 00:02:32.120
- Yes, so, huge sports fan obviously, and

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:33.620
- I can get into this
part of sports world.

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:36.160
- Yeah, you can, I'm just somebody that,

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:38.420
like let's be honest,
I'm not a fashion icon,

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:41.580
I'm more of a tomboy, I
like to be comfortable.

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:43.170
I mean that's just my jam.

00:02:43.170 --> 00:02:45.460
I wear a ballroom gown on
Dancing with the Stars,

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:47.180
I wear comfortable
clothes on the sidelines,

00:02:47.180 --> 00:02:48.330
something in between.

00:02:48.330 --> 00:02:50.380
But I felt like there
was a real white space

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:54.000
in the team apparel area for women.

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:56.130
I just felt like women
weren't being catered to,

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:57.870
there weren't many options out there,

00:02:57.870 --> 00:02:59.410
and I'm a diehard fan,

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:02.673
but I don't need the team logo
splattered across my chest.

00:03:02.673 --> 00:03:05.954
Just a fun, fashionable way
to kinda cheer for your team.

00:03:05.954 --> 00:03:09.240
And then I just felt like sizes
are very hard to deal with,

00:03:09.240 --> 00:03:12.070
we're excited cause we
have a ton of sizes.

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:15.300
Yes, absolutely, and who by
the way, wants, you know,

00:03:15.300 --> 00:03:16.300
to feel uncomfortable?

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:18.610
You wanna be feeling great, looking great,

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:20.750
and cheering for your
team at the same time.

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:23.890
In sports, my nickname is EA, so you know,

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:25.450
throw down in the field and EA is there,

00:03:25.450 --> 00:03:28.680
so we created a line called
WEAR, spelled it with the EA,

00:03:28.680 --> 00:03:32.630
