00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:57.840
- Yeah, so he's a retired hockey player,

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.890
I don't know how to skate whatsoever,

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:01.970
so basically I'm saying
there's a camera on me,

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:03.893
if you let go of me, I will kill you.

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:07.340
His family was all there
waiting for me to eat it,

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:08.210
but it was fine.

00:04:08.210 --> 00:04:09.480
- Do you love marriage though, is it good?

00:04:09.480 --> 00:04:12.309
- Yeah, it's fine, I mean
we don't see each other, so.

00:04:12.309 --> 00:04:13.720
(laughs)

00:04:13.720 --> 00:04:15.520
It seems like it's working out just fine.

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:18.140
I mean, right now with my
schedule with football,

00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:20.540
and he's working with
the Los Angeles Kings,

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:22.460
yeah, we're kind of out.

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:24.656
The only thing we really
discuss too much is

00:04:24.656 --> 00:04:26.800
when is our, did our
dog go to the bathroom?

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:29.120
And I know you have kids,
we're working on it,

00:04:29.120 --> 00:04:31.560
but it's like, right now
with a dog, it's like,

00:04:31.560 --> 00:04:34.040
you've never talked more about
poop in your entire life.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.429
It's like did he poop today?

00:04:35.429 --> 00:04:37.650
Oh, he didn't poop today, well
is he gonna poop tomorrow?

00:04:37.650 --> 00:04:40.880
I mean, I better text my mom
and ask if it's a big deal.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.070
- It is worse when it's the children,

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:45.270
cause especially boys, you
